  "_comment": "DaveLLM tool catalog. TOOL_REGISTRY, HARNESS_REGISTRY, default_tools and handler_code pin the qualified built-in tools from main before extended tools: every fingerprint input except the path-dependent compiled-code digest, plus each handler's first/last line and source digest. extended_tools and extended_handler_code pin the DAVE_ENABLE_EXTENDED_TOOLS definitions and handlers the same way.",
